Perfect! All tests are now passing. The bug was an off-by-one error in src/parse.py:4. The function was returning `parts[1]` instead of `parts[0]`, which meant it was returning the second word instead of the first word. This caused:

1. `test_basic` to fail because 'hello world' returned 'world' instead of 'hello'
